{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82a5c59030dcef2d359bad6685ee93999d155e16e6490e3ece547b718249325a",
      "text": "出演教育综艺节目的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a1e84943e7efd8e89e829079c618e1ab588f4053ed0d62b87352382ecd1c567",
      "text": "…今天的共演嘉宾里有一位蘑菇专家对吧？\n我家有他的著作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53d393eb953f7a88cac928ebc0f8cebcb86f948eb834ff1bcd4556d288ef6fab",
      "text": "那样的话，就可以一边寻找蘑菇，\n一边聊聊书的话题了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ca9c75ca24622b6843f664654071a54c13f6f9463c1dd5b4054a7cd57d64fa6",
      "text": "…嗯。\n读书和直接听本人讲述毕竟是不一样的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ac438a2cdebeed2264eddea9703128a4bc1efb9501534bbbd245b108a17145",
      "text": "…从这份工作敲定的时候起，\n我就一直很期待能和他见面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f039eba1207e7bd4813f3c38d16f3e4859fa4d7062a170bd6c8173219204b7d1",
      "text": "能听您这么说真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59a8dc0a87a5a74cac371b9955abf1ba709e07e99d6ffd22d81acefb3c425db3",
      "text": "这次是因为觉得能发挥一希先生的爱好，\n才特意争取来的工作。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:672403f22a73363656439b312445c6fd98d3a3321208b6de90fe214cdd69a468",
      "text": "…这样啊。谢谢你，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c670ad70d590e5d855ba20a83448affc01d4debbb9371e35840bf95ad26eb2",
      "text": "…今天还会讲到可食用蘑菇的话题。\n制作人要不要也借此机会了解一下？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:761220c8d898ee25854eb89ff20a913427330a75b7ae210c7d99bb419d47b99b",
      "text": "确实，合宿的时候应该能派上用场呢。\n我一定要好好学习一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_04:1_5_043_04:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52d8e2ae3d5bc7219f93700c2d3b5b3cb822092cbe61fc972ae44f261065c6ce",
      "text": "…那样的话合宿时就能去采蘑菇了呢。\n我很期待有朝一日能实现。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
